{"la:verb:adbibo":{"id":"la:verb:adbibo","lemma":"adbibo","pos":"verb","gloss":"to drink","src":"kaikki","senses":["to drink","to drink in, listen to"],"html":"<b>ad-bĭbo</b>, <i>bĭbi, bĭbĭtum, 3</i>, <i>v. a.</i><div class=\"etym\">ad, <i>intens.</i></div>, <div class=\"sense\"><i>to drink</i> (not in Cic.). </div><div class=\"sense\">Lit.: <span class=\"note\"><i>quando adbibero,</i></span>; so ; .—</div><div class=\"sense\">Trop., of discourse, <i>to drink in</i>, (cf. devorare dicta, , and ; ).—Hence of instruction, <i>to drink in eagerly</i>, <i>to listen to attentively</i>: <span class=\"note\"><i>nunc adbibe puro Pectore verba, puer,</i></span>.</div>","inflection":"bĭbi, bĭbĭtum, 3, v. a.","dict":"kaikki"},"la:name:Adbucilli":{"id":"la:name:Adbucilli","lemma":"Adbucilli","pos":"name","gloss":"proper name","src":"name"},"la:name:ADB":{"id":"la:name:ADB","lemma":"ADB","pos":"name","gloss":"proper name","src":"name"},"la:name:ADBE":{"id":"la:name:ADBE","lemma":"ADBE","pos":"name","gloss":"proper name","src":"name"}}